     C    1.00  1.00  1.00  1.00  1.00  1.00  G     PERM  'Creep and shrinkage'
     L_U  1.35  0.00  0.40  0.40  0.20  0.00  Q_1   COND  'Uniform load LM1'
     L_T  1.35  0.00  0.75  0.75  0.20  0.00  Q_1   EXCL  'Tandem load LM1'
     L_F  1.35  0.00  0.40  0.40  0.00  0.00  Q_1   COND  'Uniform load Sidewalks'
     T    1.35  0.00  0.60  0.60  0.50  1.00  Q_2   EXCL  'Temperature'
